  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Azoph-fer martial arts are passed down to you from your predecessors. You gain access to uncommon weapons with the azoph-fer trait. You become familiar with weapons with the azoph-fer trait plus the greataxe, </span>earthbreaker<span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">, greatsword, and starknife -- for the purpose of determining your proficiency, you treat these weapons that are martial weapons as simple weapons and advanced weapons as martial weapons.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">At 5th level, whenever you land a critical hit with one of these weapons, you can add its critical specialization effect.</span></p>"
